&lt;/div> --></description></item><item><title>2. Sinh quyển và hệ sinh thái</title><link>https://thaytunghanu.github.io/onlinecourse/course/suscc/2_ecology/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://thaytunghanu.github.io/onlinecourse/course/suscc/2_ecology/</guid><description>&lt;p>Giới thiệu về hệ sinh thái, các vòng tuần hoàn sinh địa hóa, và đa dạng sinh học.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="tài-liệu">Tài liệu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Đọc tài liệu: &lt;a href="https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/textbooks/96" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Theis, T., &amp;amp; Tomkin, J. (2015). Sustainability: A Comprehensive Foundation. OpenStax CNX. &lt;strong>Chapter 4&lt;/strong>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="dịch-vụ-hệ-sinh-thái">Dịch vụ hệ sinh thái&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="khái-niệm-về-kinh-tế-sinh-thái">Khái niệm về kinh tế sinh thái&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure id="figure-the-economic-subsystem-relative-to-the-global-ecosystem-apdapted-from-goodland-et-al-1992-source-mikhail-ryazanov--wikimedia-commonshttpscommonswikimediaorgwikifilediagram_of_natural_resource_flows-ensvg">
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg" alt="The Economic Subsystem Relative to the Global Ecosystem, Apdapted from Goodland et al., 1992. Source: [Mikhail Ryazanov / Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg)" loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;figcaption>
The Economic Subsystem Relative to the Global Ecosystem, Apdapted from Goodland et al., 1992. Source: &lt;a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diagram_of_natural_resource_flows-en.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mikhail Ryazanov / Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a>
&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="dịch-vụ-hệ-sinh-thái-1">Dịch vụ hệ sinh thái&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure id="figure-the-links-between-ecosystem-services-and-human-well-being-as-described-by-millennium-ecosystem-assessment-2005-source-philippe-rekacewicz-emmanuelle-bournay-unepgrid-arendalhttpswwwgridanoresources6075">
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img src="https://farm1.staticflickr.com/309/32212453272_6561509ed4_o.jpg" alt="The links between ecosystem services and human well-being as described by Millennium Ecosystem Assessment, 2005. Source: [Philippe Rekacewicz, Emmanuelle Bournay, UNEP/GRID-Arendal](https://www.grida.no/resources/6075)" loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;figcaption>
The links between ecosystem services and human well-being as described by Millennium Ecosystem Assessment, 2005. Source: &lt;a href="https://www.grida.no/resources/6075" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Philippe Rekacewicz, Emmanuelle Bournay, UNEP/GRID-Arendal&lt;/a>
&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="ví-dụ-về-các-dịch-vụ-hệ-sinh-thái">Ví dụ về các dịch vụ hệ sinh thái&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>
