&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img src="https://farm1.staticflickr.com/555/31513890124_936a637bca_o.jpg" alt="23 of the most key ecosystem services and the different ways they can be categorized. Source: [GRID-Arendal](https://www.grida.no/resources/8141)" loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;figcaption>
23 of the most key ecosystem services and the different ways they can be categorized. Source: &lt;a href="https://www.grida.no/resources/8141" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GRID-Arendal&lt;/a>
&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="các-chu-trình-sinh-địa-hóa">Các chu trình sinh địa hóa&lt;/h2>
